            <title>[LU-20424] osd_fid_unpack() unexpected packed fid size: 0</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20424</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;with linux 6.12 kernel readdir can't find FIDs in direntries:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
[   32.293651] LustreError: 7557:0:(osd_internal.h:1549:osd_fid_unpack()) unexpected packed fid size: 0
[   32.293833] LustreError: 7557:0:(osd_internal.h:1549:osd_fid_unpack()) Skipped 14381 previous similar messages
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;this is due to missing code in ext4_htree_store_dirent() saving dirdata to in-core tree.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
